  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Tourism Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Turismo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es aumentar la contribucin del sector turismo al desarrollo socioeconmico nacional. El propsito es el incremento del ingreso y el empleo tursticos en las dos reas de intervencin de forma sustentable.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to increase the tourism sectors contribution to the countrys socioeconomic development. The purpose is to increase tourism revenues and jobs on a sustainable basis in the two areas targeted by the program.</narrative>
  </description>
